# FreshRSS-specific, NON-SECRET config. This file IS committed.
#
# Shared values (TZ, CONFIG_ROOT, ADMIN_DOMAIN) live in ../../common.env.
# Values here win over common.env — both are passed as --env-file, later wins.
#
# The one secret this stack needs is FRESHRSS_ADMIN_PASSWORD. It is a Komodo
# Variable with "Secret" enabled, injected through komodo.env, and it must
# exist BEFORE the first deploy. See komodo/resources/stacks.toml.
#
# PUID/PGID are intentionally not used by this stack: the image runs Apache as
# root and drops to www-data itself.

# Nothing FreshRSS-specific needed yet. The refresh schedule (CRON_MIN) and
# the trusted proxy range are in compose.yaml, next to the comments that
# explain them.
